f57e03ba-071e-4f34-9503-3a555a533e2c	c804ea91-f332-4462-a595-00eb1d8dd442	deal	a8cf242f-e9e1-42f1-8d6d-b316b20fb1f7	note	Hours 69–70: Full manual walkthrough — cold demo simulation\n\nLet's do this as if you're the CTO seeing it for the first time. Walk through in order:\n\nLogin → Dashboard — confirm the funnel and summary cards reflect the full 8-deal dataset accurately\nKanban board — should show 4 open deals distributed across "New"/"Qualified"\nContacts / Accounts lists — 8+ companies, click into 2-3 detail pages\nDeals list — all 8 with correct status badges (won=green, lost=red, open=blue)\nPick 3 different deals (one open, one won, one lost) and for each:\nOpen detail page, read the Timeline\nClick "Generate Summary" — confirm it reads naturally for that deal's actual state\nAsk the AI Sidebar 1-2 questions specific to that deal's notes\nLeads → create and convert one fresh lead, confirm it still works cleanly alongside the new demo data\nDelete something (a throwaway test record) to confirm that still works post-seeding\nHours 70–71: Edge case pass — the roadmap's original hardening checklist\n\nWhile you're doing the walkthrough, also deliberately try:\n\nA deal with zero activities — do you have one? If all 8 seeded deals have notes, create one fresh empty deal via "+ New Deal" and check its Timeline/Summary/Sidebar all degrade gracefully (should show "no activity yet," "not enough activity history," etc. — not crash)\nA very long note — paste a few paragraphs into "Add a note" on any deal, confirm chunking handles it (check activity_chunks afterward: SELECT activity_id, count(*) FROM activity_chunks GROUP BY activity_id HAVING count(*) > 1; should show it split into multiple chunks)\nThe AI Sidebar with zero relevant results — you've already proven this works (the weather question test), but worth reconfirming once with the fuller dataset in place, since more notes means more candidates that could theoretically cross the relevance threshold unexpectedly\n\nGo through steps 1-7 plus the edge cases and report back — plain pass/fail per item is fine, flag anything that looks off. This is the last real checkpoint before Day 10's deploy, so worth being thorough here.	\N	\N	ecd01b45-6b4f-470b-a3c3-dc999a55ec83	2026-07-22 14:21:47.477307+00
